note
note tools/estimation/est_eval.om -- EST-3 evaluation in pure seeded OM-2 (protocol v1
note sections 4 and 5; --protocol-v2 for EST23_PROTOCOL_V2). Replaces est_eval.c.
note   est_eval --params P --raw machine-state.ndjson --marks machine-state-marks.txt
note            --out receipt.json [--recorded] [--synthetic-test]
note   est_eval --protocol-v2 --params2 P2 --raw F --marks M --out R [--protocol-doc D]
note            [--recorded] [--synthetic-test]
note Takes the parameter file and the held-out file only; never fits. Refuses when the
note parameter file was not fit on run A (unless --synthetic-test), and refuses run B
note unless --recorded. Writes a JSON receipt and one stream per evaluated model.
note Composed after: est_defs.om est_math.om est_types.om est_kf.om est_mix.om est_pred.om
note est_v4.om est_replay.om and a generated toolid.om that defines
note   text t_ee_tool_commit "<commit>"   const EE_TOOL_DIRTY ulong 0|1   const EE_TEST_BUILD ulong 0|1
note (the build-time TOOL_COMMIT / TOOL_DIRTY / EST_TEST_BUILD of the C tool).

